# gnome-session, nautilus, eog, gnome-terminal, ...); ours (publisher
# oi-local, locked by the userland incorporation) replace them.  pkglint
# only sees OI's catalog and takes them for dependencies on obsolete
# packages, hence pkg.linted (action005) on every dependency of this file.

